'''Leaf '''is a [[Common Weapons|common]] knife that is obtainable by unboxing it from [[Mystery Box 2]] or through trading.
== Appearance ==
It has a shamrock green leaf-textured blade, hence the name, featuring the leaf’s midrib, veins, and venules, which are a slightly lighter shade of green. It has a forest green guard and a dark green handle.

==Trivia==
*This is one of the knives added alongside the [[Season 1]] update.

